# Uniko Beauties — GitHub sync

Remote: `https://github.com/Roshanalikhan2002/unikobeauties.git` branch **`main`**.

After you change project files in this workspace:

1. If **`index.html`** changed, run `python build-shopify-theme.py` so Shopify theme files stay in sync.
2. `git add` relevant files (never commit secrets).
3. Commit with a clear message. Do not update global git config; use per-invocation identity:
   `git -c user.name="Roshanalikhan2002" -c user.email="Roshanalikhan2002@users.noreply.github.com" commit -m "..."`
4. **`git push origin main`** before considering the task done (unless push fails for auth — then tell the user to push manually).

Only skip push when the user explicitly says not to commit or not to push.